{"item": "e197", "oracle_pass": false, "evidence": "checker: Rule judge for NUM with 5% relative tolerance: number of parsed values differs. Model=[8.0, 0.15], reference=[0.16]. ", "skill_hash": "5f61deb4e13b", "truth_source": "checker", "skill_result": "\\frac{r}{b} = \\sqrt{\\dfrac{G}{8\\pi^{2}\\rho H_v}} \\approx 0.15", "failure_reason": "该解答把螺位错的应变能密度取成 $\\tfrac12 G\\gamma^{2}=Gb^{2}/(8\\pi^{2}r^{2})$，多带了那个 $\\tfrac12$ 因子；本题（教材对\"位错单位体积弹性能\"的约定）应取 $G\\gamma^{2}=Gb^{2}/(4\\pi^{2}r^{2})$，由判据 $u=\\rho H_v$ 得 $(r/b)^{2}=G/(4\\pi^{2}\\rho H_v)$。错在能量密度公式的系数/约定选错（与有效数字无关），使 $(r/b)^{2}$ 偏小 2 倍、开方后 $r/b$ 系统性偏低。"}
